flowchart TB
    GH[GitHub Actions<br/>CI, Terraform plan/apply, app release]
    Internet((Internet))
    ECR[Private ECR<br/>immutable scanned images]
    SSM[Systems Manager Parameter Store<br/>current image tag]
    S3State[(Encrypted S3 Terraform state<br/>native state lock)]
    subgraph AWS[ AWS account · ap-south-1 ]
      subgraph VPC[VPC across two Availability Zones]
        IGW[Internet Gateway]
        ALB[Public Application Load Balancer<br/>HTTP :80 · access logs enabled]
        Logs[(Private S3 ALB access logs)]
        NAT1[NAT Gateway AZ-a]
        NAT2[NAT Gateway AZ-b]
        subgraph AZA[Availability Zone A]
          AppA[Private app subnet<br/>EC2 Auto Scaling instance]
          DBA[Private isolated DB subnet]
        end
        subgraph AZB[Availability Zone B]
          AppB[Private app subnet<br/>EC2 Auto Scaling instance]
          DBB[Private isolated DB subnet]
        end
        RDS[(Encrypted Multi-AZ MySQL RDS<br/>private subnets)]
        Secret[Secrets Manager<br/>generated DB credentials]
        CW[CloudWatch application logs]
      end
    end

    Internet -->|HTTP :80| IGW --> ALB
    ALB -->|app port :8080| AppA
    ALB -->|app port :8080| AppB
    ALB --> Logs
    AppA -->|MySQL :3306| RDS
    AppB -->|MySQL :3306| RDS
    DBA --- RDS
    DBB --- RDS
    AppA --> CW
    AppB --> CW
    AppA -->|read secret via instance role| Secret
    AppB -->|read secret via instance role| Secret
    AppA -->|outbound via NAT| NAT1
    AppB -->|outbound via NAT| NAT2
    NAT1 --> IGW
    NAT2 --> IGW
    GH -->|GitHub OIDC short-lived roles| AWS
    GH -->|push immutable image| ECR
    GH -->|update current tag| SSM
    GH -->|Terraform backend| S3State
    ECR -->|pull image using instance role| AppA
    ECR -->|pull image using instance role| AppB
